SGMethod=1
Cmn1=Dynamic Source/Destination config for user-configurable systems.
Cmn2=\\Currently supports up to 12 sources and 4 destinations\\\\\\system.
Cmn3=init - initialize file if there isn't one present\\file.read - read||1
Cmn4=config file\\file.write - write config file\\\\src.press_val - item_clicked||1
Cmn5=from source edit page-1.  Generic source index value\\src.new_val||1
Cmn6=- next available source value determined by U-AV Driver\\src.input_val||1
Cmn7=- item_clicked from list of available source values\\src.page.type||1
Cmn8=- item clicked from list of page types\\\\icon.xsig - global list||1
Cmn9=of icon values available to system\\src.val.xsig - predetermined||1
Cmn10=source values to be distributed and saved as src_val.\\\\tp.src.
Cmn11=add - digital press to add a new source\\tp.src.remove - digital||1
Cmn12=press to remove source, blanks name to make source invalid\\\\src.
Cmn13=page.type.xsig.rx$ - page type names from IO config, \\src.page.
Cmn14=type.xsig.tx$ - page type name to fusion ssi module for device usage||1
Cmn15=reporting\\\\dest.press_val - item_clicked from list of available||1
Cmn16=destinations\\dest.disp_val - value of display attached to destination\\
Cmn17=dest.num_items - number of display types available for destination\\
Cmn18=dest.name$ - name of destination saved in file\\disp.model.xsig||1
Cmn19=- list of available displays for destination\\\\Params:\\Zone (2-
Cmn20=Digit) Zone value, 2 digits so use leading 0s.  Stored as string.
Cmn21=\\File-Name - Proper name for IO config file.  Extension is appended.
Cmn22=||1(.dat)\\
]
